{"3110070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fever Meme", "steam_appid": 3110070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fever Meme is a comedy/parody game that pivots between multiple genres as it spits in the face of traditional game design. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/extras/76573acb5015a1554b89c2a4e5af0434.poster.avif?t=1764329811\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/extras/76573acb5015a1554b89c2a4e5af0434.webm?t=1764329811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/extras/76573acb5015a1554b89c2a4e5af0434.mp4?t=1764329811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>One moment you'll be in a 2007-esque rage platformer, the next moment you'll be in the game show with a giant spider. But beneath all of the trolls and humor is a deeper overarching story. The game is self-aware of your actions as you play, your past mistakes, and so much more. And the further you make it into the game, the more the dynamic between player and creator is explored as the fourth wall is completely stripped away.<br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER: Do not play if you are prone to photosensitive epilepsy or are sensitive to loud audio.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fever Meme is a comedy/parody game that pivots between multiple genres as it spits in the face of traditional game design. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/extras/76573acb5015a1554b89c2a4e5af0434.poster.avif?t=1764329811\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/extras/76573acb5015a1554b89c2a4e5af0434.webm?t=1764329811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/extras/76573acb5015a1554b89c2a4e5af0434.mp4?t=1764329811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>One moment you'll be in a 2007-esque rage platformer, the next moment you'll be in the game show with a giant spider. But beneath all of the trolls and humor is a deeper overarching story. The game is self-aware of your actions as you play, your past mistakes, and so much more. And the further you make it into the game, the more the dynamic between player and creator is explored as the fourth wall is completely stripped away.<br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER: Do not play if you are prone to photosensitive epilepsy or are sensitive to loud audio.</strong></p>", "short_description": "This game is a cross between The Stanley Parable, Undertale, and rage games like I Wanna Be the Guy. And the deeper you get, the less the fourth wall is respected. This game is a parody of game design and laughs on the surface, but there is a deeper and darker story to this game's origin to unravel.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Fever Meme is an incredibly overstimulating game. It’s brash, bold, and incredibly in-your-face at almost every moment.”<br>Highly Recommended – VICE<br><br>“Trolling people is an art form, and a lot of people just don’t have the talent or the drive it takes to really do it well. So when you find someone who is putting real skill and effort into rage-baiting people, you have to respect the lengths they go to for a dream and a love of the game.”<br>Kotaku<br><br>“If you enjoy satire and games where choices truly matter, this one may surprise you.”<br>4.2/5 – Softonic<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/9dcb40dbdcbf02c9a1f16a9c5a656e2994dd1afe/header.jpg?t=1764329811", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/42c6616cf88777c774499b46d65b262bb05daeaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764329811", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110070/42c6616cf88777c774499b46d65b262bb05daeaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764329811", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Game may behave unpredictably at low frame rates (&lt;45 FPS). Use of older laptops or integrated GPUs is not recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Aimbok"], "publishers": ["Aimbok"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 420, "final": 420, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.20"}, "packages": [1104625], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Fever Meme", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1104625, "percent_savings_text"